Smart Multi-Floor Car Parking Management System using Verilog HDL

This project implements a smart parking management system designed for large-scale applications such as shopping malls, residential apartments, office complexes
The system supports up to 200 parking slots distributed across four floors and automatically assigns the nearest available parking slot to incoming vehicles.
The design is developed using Verilog HDL and follows a modular RTL architecture suitable for FPGA implementation and digital VLSI design learning.

Design flow

Vehicle Entry
      │
      ▼
Check Available Slots
      │
      ▼
Allocate Lowest Available Slot
      │
      ▼
Update Parking Memory
      │
      ▼
Display Floor & Slot Number
      │
      ▼
Update Occupancy Statistics

